// ================= v3.27.2 · FREE CITY NAMES + FORTIFIED ZONES =================
//
// CITY NAMES
// - any existing city/capital can now be renamed, regardless of owner;
// - this is cosmetic/geographic metadata and does not change ownership;
// - custom names persist if the city changes hands.
//
// FORTIFICATIONS
// - the shield/castle icon is removed from the map;
// - contiguous fortified hexes of the same faction are rendered as ONE visual
//   fortified zone: only the external perimeter is drawn;
// - internal shared edges disappear, so several adjacent forts read as a line
//   of fortifications rather than a field of icons;
// - fort level changes line weight subtly;
// - only visible max-LOD cells are evaluated, protecting render performance.


// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1. RENAME ANY CITY / CAPITAL
