// Strategic layer for AI nations. This intentionally remains territorial rather
// than turning OpenFront into an individual-unit RTS.
//
// Core invariants:
// - troops3230[f] is the UNCOMMITTED strategic reserve for AI factions;
// - AI front.assignedForces is removed from that reserve while committed;
// - capital/territorial/coastal garrisons are also separate committed pools;
// - the same soldier can therefore never belong to two fronts at once;
// - AI recruitment is capped against reserve + fronts + garrisons, avoiding
